OL,3,GNEWSAMan lost #10k in fake Martin Lewis
OL,4,Aadvert scam                            
OL,6,FA man who lost nearly #10,000 in a     
OL,7,Fcryptocurrency investment scam has     
OL,8,Fwarned people about the dangers of     
OL,9,Fsocial media adverts promising quick   
OL,10,Friches.                                
OL,12,FMichael Tasker, 77, from               
OL,13,FChapel-en-le-Frith in Derbyshire,      
OL,14,Finitially invested #200 after promises 
OL,15,Fof massive returns in Bitcoin.         
OL,17,FHe said he did so after scammers       
OL,18,Fconvinced him a fake advert - which    
OL,19,Ffalsely appeared to be endorsed by TV  
OL,20,Ffinance expert Martin Lewis - was a    
OL,21,Flegitimate investment opportunity and  
OL,22,Fwent on to lose thousands more.        
